{"title":"2007 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/8/3c8a375bfc9437ffab6a07be7b29669ea8d12d66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4 \\times 12) - (4 + 12)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"151\" height=\"20\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/9/e39e3cb703df8917d93dd1cbe570da8bc306a154.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 8 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 16 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 20 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 24 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 32$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"387\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Order_of_operations\" title=\"Order of operations\">order of operations</a>, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/5/2352e4d7e778e82f97ce41be84a1ea696d6ec18f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4 \\times 12) - (4 + 12) = 48 - 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"234\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/1/6410cccd63979c1d72e096dc92d8d47bd9460f8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"50\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qwqoP9Nvtjs&amp;t=1s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qwqoP9Nvtjs&amp;t=1s</a> (also includes problems 2-10)\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2007 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2007 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2007 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2007 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 2